  // BUG-104: Fixed-amount coupons split the discount strangely across lines
  // 1000 cents discount on 3 lines of 1000 cents each.
  // Weights: [1000, 1000, 1000]. Sum of weights = 3000.
  // Parts: floor(1000 * 1000 / 3000) = 333.
